The engine sources under third_party/pico/lib and the language data under lang/
are that work, vendored from the picotts distribution of the Android Open Source
Project's external/svox. They are unmodified except for three small changes
needed to build them for Windows, each marked in the source and listed in
docs/notes.md.

The SAPI 5 engine itself -- everything under src/, tools/ and installer/ -- is
new work for this port and is released under the same Apache License 2.0, in
LICENSE.
